WEBVTT

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:13.910
"U.E. 505"

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:17.660
"Heavenly Gate Plaza,
 Rondacia Palace"

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.660
What a nasty mess.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.870
That accursed Beevee Liscar.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.040
But then, our Unified Zesskia has
the Duke of Kal-o, Ray Dawn!

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:29.580
"Duke of Kal-o: Ray Dawn"

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:33.080
His fairy is a threat.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.200
And like him, I am a Fairy Soldier.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:40.080
Ultimately, a fairy depends on its user.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.540
It can be harmful, or beneficial.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:46.000
"Unified Zesskia 
Minister of the Military:
Bruno Bohme"

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.000
Yes, indeed! It's just as you say!

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.120
Now, this way please.
His Imperial Majesty awaits you.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:54.580
In any age, excessive power...

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:00.290
Fairies make foolish humans go astray.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:05.000
"38 years ago"

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:18.790
There's no such thing as truth.
We end up falsifying even facts.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:22.120
Sometimes we cover them up to try to hide them.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.950
"Fairy village Suna resident:
Ray Dawn (in his youth)"

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.950
Ray.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.200
What're you doing? Come on.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.370
Sure. Sorry, Jurgen.

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:33.620
"Fairy village Suna 
resident: Jurgen Dawn"

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.620
There are so many fairies.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:37.540
They're fairy primordials.
Once they possess an animal

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:41.500
and become fairy imaginals,
they're totally different.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.370
My hometown, Suna.

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:52.540
Some say Crucia Albastora,
who wrote the Black Fairy Tome,

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:58.700
brought those who could see fairy
primordials here to settle a village.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:02.250
And that the people of Suna
are their descendants.

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.290
That's a fairy imaginal?

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:08.080
Yeah. Be careful, Ray.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:13.620
People called places like Suna,
blessed with an abundant environment

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:19.000
and where many fairy primordials dwell,
a "fairy village."

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:23.330
Another fairy imaginal?!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.500
There used to be fairy villages
located here and there.

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.750
It's said most of them were lost due
to the overhunting of fairies.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:47.330
Those who worship fairies say fairies
are pure, and therefore innocent.

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:50.500
If they're pure, is everything
they do permissible?

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.790
Isn't it their purity that makes them a threat?

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:00.160
"19 years ago - Suna"

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:05.120
Guardians protect Suna's forest
and the fairies that live there.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:09.540
They devote everything to passing it
along to the next generation.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:14.200
"Fairy village Suna 
guardian: Thori Dawn"

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:11.700
Our father was a brave, "upright" man.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:17.830
He stuck to a path that we
were unable to choose.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:19.410
Ivan, Olek.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:33.620
She's going to give birth soon?

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:35.500
Yes, should be soon.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.330
"Fairy village Suna 
guardian: Olek Gunnar"

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.330
I bet it'll be a girl.

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:41.160
One's here.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.540
And close.

00:03:56.580 --> 00:04:02.580
I'm sure of it. It's the Esteemed One
who came here over 20 years ago.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:07.370
Somehow, we must stop them...
so the fairies don't injure each other.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.870
What do we do?

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.660
Our only choice is to separate them.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.040
It's dangerous, though.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.000
I'll handle this.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.950
Ivan...

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:26.120
All right, we'll leave it to you.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.330
Be careful.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:28.500
Yeah.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.830
I think it's a girl, too.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:34.950
That a hunch?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:36.290
I suppose.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.200
"Fairy village Suna 
guardian: Ivan Noel"

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.950
A name's already picked out.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:40.200
Marlya.

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:43.450
Nice name.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.000
I'll draw its attention.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.410
Got to slow it down!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:14.750
Shit!

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:29.750
There, there...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:41.250
"Fairy village Suna 
resident: Tereza Noel"

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:39.910
I'm sorry... Ivan.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:49.580
I won't get to raise our child...

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:53.410
Marlya...!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.450
"Episode 13"

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:35.950
"Suna guardian lodge"

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.040
Ivan sacrificed himself...

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:38.870
Thanks to that, the Esteemed One
should calm down for a time.

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:42.080
Ivan... And with a daughter just born...

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:46.660
The child was fine, but the mother, Tereza...

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:50.500
And here, she had been
so robust since childhood.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.870
It's just one misfortune after the next.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.120
I suspect it is all the will of the fairies.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:04.290
But, there's no guarantee the
Esteemed One will not come to the village.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.620
We must hold the ritual before that happens.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:11.080
Just a moment, Lady Deira.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:12.870
There must be some other way.

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:16.540
Once the Esteemed One comes
to the village, it will be too late.

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:16.540
"Fairy village Suna 
fortuneteller: Deira"

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.790
I am aware of that.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.790
We must prepare.

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:28.700
Read the stars, Deira, and choose one
who's blessed with good fortune.

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:33.290
A blessed child who suits a fairy's heart.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:38.040
If you want a <i>cursed</i> child,
the stars already pointed one out.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:47.450
Ivan and Tereza's daughter, Marlya.
She's bad luck.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:00.330
Are you really going to do it?

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.120
Yes.

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:04.040
We must not hold the ritual.

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:08.700
But, if a small sacrifice means
Suna can be saved...

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:14.040
How many blessed children do you
think we'll select and sacrifice

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.750
before the Esteemed One is fully calmed?

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.750
You think one won't be enough?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:26.620
The ritual was held when I was young,
and four sacrificed themselves.

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:31.950
One of them... was my sister.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:37.700
Olek.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.750
Yes, sir?

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:41.950
When the war ends, if my sons...

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:46.450
If Jurgen and Ray return safely
to Suna, tell them this.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:51.410
"Your father was a guardian until the end."

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:52.660
Go back to the village.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:53.540
But...!

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:54.750
Go!

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.410
Please, be safe.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.910
I won't let the ritual happen.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:11.620
I will lead the Esteemed One
deep into the forest!

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.660
As a guardian.

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:27.700
"U.E. 505"

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:27.700
Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn...!

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:42.000
"14 years ago"

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:53.160
"Fairy village Suna 
resident: Jurgen Dawn"

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:52.120
Your father and my father were both guardians.

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:55.790
Right up to the end, they devoted
themselves to Suna and the fairies,

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:58.910
and fulfilled their lives as guardians.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:34.700
Jurgen. You hurt your leg in the war, right?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:41.370
Pretty much. I'm just lucky
I didn't wind up dead.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:45.330
Isn't your brother in the war, too?

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.200
Ray?

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.080
What's he doing now?

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.750
He's not like me.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.830
He's a success.

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:58.040
Right now, he's a Kal-o general.

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.370
This way!

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.700
Wait up!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.120
See!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.700
Oh!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.370
Hey!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.700
Welcome back!

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:14.160
Welcome back, guardian!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:15.410
Hello, Ver.

00:12:15.410 --> 00:12:18.080
Thank you for doing your important job!

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.700
I'm just doing my duty.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.250
Someone has to do it, after all.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.910
Hey, did you see any fairies?

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.790
Well now...

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:28.750
That's a secret.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.250
Aww, no fair!

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.660
Guardian...

00:12:33.660 --> 00:12:37.290
My father was a guardian too.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:44.160
Dad ended up dying on the day I was born.

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:50.750
And Mom died from giving birth to me.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:03.500
Oh, it's Marlya!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:08.540
Go away! Bad things happen when you're around!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:10.200
Go away!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:14.540
Gotcha!

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.580
Ver, you're so fast!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:25.620
You're the cursed...!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.120
I'm sorry!

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.700
Fairies.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:53.950
Come here.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:14:00.620
If you get any closer, the fairies
will get scared and run off.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.330
Is this your first time in the forest?

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:04.370
Yeah.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:08.830
I've been lots of times. But I sneak in,
because I get in trouble if I get caught.

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:18.000
I'm Veronica. You're Marlya?

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:23.250
If you know that, then why? I--

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:26.830
Don't, Veronica.

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:30.370
Call me "Ver."

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:35.540
Ver, if you're nice to me,
I'm sure something bad'll happen.

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:36.580
No, it won't.

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:41.370
But everyone says so. Even Mom and Dad both--

00:14:41.370 --> 00:14:44.250
I don't believe in that stuff.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:52.750
It's okay. Absolutely nothing
bad is going to happen.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.450
"12 years ago - Suna"

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.790
You too, Marlya.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.290
No, that's okay.

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.870
Why not?

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:34.500
It might not like me.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:54.080
They say on the day I was born,
there was a big rainbow in the sky.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:57.830
Ver is a blessed child.
That's what everyone says.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:02.790
She's always smiling, bringing happiness
to those around her.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:07.870
Every year on my birthday, the weather
is really clear and the stars are pretty.

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:12.330
The old man who lives next door got over
his disease while we were together.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:17.160
And since I've been born, not a
single relative of mine has died.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.660
Oh yeah?

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:22.660
And so, they say I'm a blessed child.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.830
Isn't that ridiculous?

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:26.410
Ridiculous?

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:30.290
I mean, those are all coincidences, of course!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.580
But that's...

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.080
It's fine, though.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:37.290
If everyone's glad that I'm a blessed child...

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:42.790
It doesn't bother me, and if
everyone's happy, I'm happy.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.330
I...

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:52.330
I have so much fun when I'm with you, Ver.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.830
Thanks!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:56.500
Snow!

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.120
So pretty!

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:12.830
What the...?

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:28.750
Ray, what's the meaning of this?

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:35.870
Now that you're a Kal-o general, you can't
even hear the voice of your ruined brother?

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:38.660
I can hear you, Jurgen.

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:41.000
I've come to do what must be done.

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:43.000
I'm asking you what that is!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:47.080
Fairies have no will of their own.
It's foolish to let them run loose.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:52.580
What an outrage! You would do this,
when your father was a guardian?!

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:53.410
Do it!

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:54.620
Burn it down!

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:01.290
Why?

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:07.830
This isn't Kal-o's idea... Not the king's.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.160
Ray! <i>You</i> chose to do this!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:16.870
The king gave the command to seize
Suna's people, and all the fairies.

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.660
For military use?!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:26.410
But in order to end the war, I decided
the fairy village should be eliminated.

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:29.750
Excessive power must be controlled.

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:33.790
Otherwise it will go to people's
heads and lead them astray.

00:18:33.790 --> 00:18:36.120
As it has done to you!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:45.750
Jurgen...

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:50.540
Run!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:57.540
Ray, he's your own brother!

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.540
.Help the women and children escape first!

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.080
Let's go, Marlya!

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:00.620
Jurgen!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.580
General!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.700
Don't let anyone escape!

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:06.910
Yes, sir!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:19.870
Halt!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.080
What's with this dog?!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.200
Monika!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.500
Jurgen said to run.

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.290
You two! This way!

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.910
Ivan's daughter?

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.410
The cursed one...

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.000
Run!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:13.080
Ray Dawn. And you were <i>born</i> in Suna...

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.120
I swear you'll pay for this!

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:19.580
I swear it. I swear you'll pay!

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:25.580
Find them! Our orders are to not
leave a single Suna villager alive!

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:30.160
Jurgen, Monika... I'm sorry!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.370
It... It's because I'm a cursed child!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.410
No! It's not your fault!

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.830
But...

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:43.750
I'll draw the soldiers away.
Use that time to escape.

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:46.160
If you do that, you'll be...

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.620
It's okay. You know I'm fast, don't you?

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:52.540
They won't catch me.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:53.700
But...

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:56.000
If we stay here, they'll find us at some point.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:59.160
You know what'll happen if they do, right?

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.330
Get away.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.620
Make sure you survive.

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:08.330
Ver...! Ver!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:23.290
This world's crime, punishment, pain,
suffering, sorrow, joy, all of it...

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:36.790
Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn...!

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:44.910
...all of it belongs to we humans.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:54.700
Even if you get revenge, the past won't change.

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.660
I realize that.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:02.620
I don't need a past or a future.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:05.160
I'll see he gets what he deserves.

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:08.080
That's good enough for me.

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:42.120
Looks like someone is out to kill me.

00:23:40.700 --> 00:23:42.120
What the hell happened?!

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:42.870
Ver!

00:23:42.870 --> 00:23:44.000
Do you think you have the right to live?

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:48.450
For what purpose do you fight?
What will you have left?

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:48.450
"Next time"
